## Design a Sudoku search agent

Specialize a search agent for Sudoku. Use the given board to choose watches and interpret assignment changes, then implement the deductions and decision policy required by your design. This page is a project brief rather than an executable solution; start from the neighbouring agent skeleton and the wrapper’s callback examples.
